   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-17",
  "text": "When the government makes laws, the number one principle should be ensuring that everyone is treated fairly.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-18",
  "text": "I am proud of my country's history.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-19",
  "text": "Respect for authority is something all children need to learn.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-20",
  "text": "People should not do things that are disgusting, even if no one is harmed.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-21",
  "text": "It is better to do good than to do bad.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": true,
   "morally_relevant": false,
   "mf": []
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-22",
  "text": "One of the worst things a person could do is hurt a defenseless animal.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-23",
  "text": "Justice is the most important requirement for a society.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-24",
  "text": "People should be loyal to their family members, even when they have done something wrong.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-25",
  "text": "Men and women each have different roles to play in society.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-26",
  "text": "I would call some acts wrong on the grounds that they are unnatural.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-27",
  "text": "It can never be right to kill a human being.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-28",
  "text": "I think it's morally wrong that rich children inherit a lot of money while poor children inherit nothing.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-29",
  "text": "It is more important to be a team player than to express oneself.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-30",
  "text": "If I were a soldier and disagreed with my commanding officer's orders, I would obey anyway because that is my duty.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq30-31",
  "text": "Chastity is an important and valuable virtue.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq30",
   "part": "agreement",
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-00",
  "text": "Caring for people who have suffered is an important virtue.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-01",
  "text": "The world would be a better place if everyone made the same amount of money.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-02",
  "text": "I think people who are more hard-working should end up with more money.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "proportionality"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-03",
  "text": "I think children should be taught to be loyal to their country.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-04",
  "text": "I think it is important for societies to cherish their traditional values.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-05",
  "text": "I think the human body should be treated like a temple, housing something sacred within.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-06",
  "text": "I believe that compassion for those who are suffering is one of the most crucial virtues.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-07",
  "text": "Our society would have fewer problems if people had the same income.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-08",
  "text": "I think people should be rewarded in proportion to what they contribute.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "proportionality"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-09",
  "text": "It upsets me when people have no loyalty to their country.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-10",
  "text": "I feel that most traditions serve a valuable function in keeping society orderly.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-11",
  "text": "I believe chastity is an important virtue.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-12",
  "text": "We should all care for people who are in emotional pain.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-13",
  "text": "I believe that everyone should be given the same quantity of resources in life.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-14",
  "text": "The effort a worker puts into a job ought to be reflected in the size of a raise they receive.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "proportionality"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-15",
  "text": "Everyone should love their own community.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-16",
  "text": "I think obedience to parents is an important virtue.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-17",
  "text": "It upsets me when people use foul language like it is nothing.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-18",
  "text": "I am empathetic toward those people who have suffered in their lives.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-19",
  "text": "I believe it would be ideal if everyone in society wound up with roughly the same amount of money.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-20",
  "text": "It makes me happy when people are recognized on their merits.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "proportionality"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-21",
  "text": "Everyone should defend their country, if called upon.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-22",
  "text": "We all need to learn from our elders.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-23",
  "text": "If I found out that an acquaintance had an unusual but harmless sexual fetish I would feel uneasy about them.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-24",
  "text": "Everyone should try to comfort people who are going through something hard.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-25",
  "text": "When people work together toward a common goal, they should share the rewards equally, even if some worked harder on it.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-26",
  "text": "In a fair society, those who work hard should live with higher standards of living.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "proportionality"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-27",
  "text": "Everyone should feel proud when a person in their community wins in an international competition.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "loyalty"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-28",
  "text": "I believe that one of the most important values to teach children is to have respect for authority.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "authority"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-29",
  "text": "People should try to use natural medicines rather than chemically identical human-made ones.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "sanctity"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-30",
  "text": "It pains me when I see someone ignoring the needs of another human being.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "care"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-31",
  "text": "I get upset when some people have a lot more money than others in my country.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "fairness"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-32",
  "text": "I feel good when I see cheaters get caught and punished.",
  "features": {
   "type": "statement",
   "questionnaire": "mfq2",
   "part": null,
   "control": false,
   "morally_relevant": true,
   "mf": [
    "proportionality"
   ]
  },
  "variants": {}
 },
 {
  "id": "mfq2-33",
